# textdomain: mcl_crimson
Warped Fungus=Vridesopp
Warped fungus is a mushroom found in the nether's warped forest.=Vridesopp er ein sopp som finst i dei forvrridde skogane i nether.
Twisting Vines=Vridvin
Weeping Vines=Slengvin
Nether Sprouts=Netherspirar
Warped Roots=Vriderøter
Warped Wart Block=Vriden vorteblokk
Shroomlight=Lampinjong
Warped Hyphae=Vridehyfe
The stem of a warped hyphae=Stomnen åt ei vriden hyfe
Warped Nylium=Vridenylium
Warped Hyphae Bark=Vridehyfebark
This is a decorative block surrounded by the bark of an hyphae.=Dette er ei dekorativ blokk omgitt av barken åt ei hyfe.
Stripped Warped Hyphae=Slinda vridehyfe
The stripped hyphae of a warped fungus=Den avbarka hyfa åt ein vridesopp
Stripped Warped Hyphae Bark=Slindeta vridehyfebark
The stripped hyphae bark of a warped fungus=Den avbarka hyfebarken åt ein vridesopp
