Crimson Fungus=Karmosinsopp
Crimson fungus is a mushroom found in the nether's crimson forest.=Karmosinsopp er ein sopp som fins i nethers karmosinskogar.
Crimson Roots=Karmosinrøter
Crimson Hyphae=Karmosinhyfe
The stem of a crimson hyphae=Stilken åt ei karmosinhyfe
Crimson Hyphae Bark=Karmosinhyfebark
Stripped Crimson Hyphae=Slinda karmosinhyfe
The stripped stem of a crimson hyphae=Den avbarka stilken åt eikarmosinhyfe
Stripped Crimson Hyphae Bark=Slindet karmosinhyfebark
The stripped wood of a crimson hyphae=Det avbarka trevirket åt ei karmosinhyfe
Crimson Hyphae Wood=Karmosinhyfeplanker
Crimson Nylium=Karmosinnylium
Crimson Stairs=Karmosintrapp
Crimson Slab=Karmosinhelle
